<title>USA: Aydin to post Q3 gain from facility sale.</title>
<headline>Aydin to post Q3 gain from facility sale.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aydin Corp said on Friday that it expects to post a $1.8 million gain in the third quarter from the sale of its facility in San Jose, Calif. for $10 million.</p>
<p>The sale closed on July 17, Aydin said in a statement.</p>
<p>Aydin, a maker of telecommunications equipment and radar systems, said it has several product introductions scheduled for the second half of the year and the new products should result in sales growth.</p>
</text>
